    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50398" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnātūra</span></b> ,
		ae, f.
		venor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>hunting</i>, <i>the chase;</i> trop.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viden' tu illam oculis venaturam facere atque
					aucupium auribus?</span>”
				
					<i>how she hunts about with her eyes? is on the watch?</i>
				
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Mil. 4, 1, 43</span></i>
			.</div>
